================================================================================
CONCLUSION
================================================================================
The MCP connector transforms the governed supply chain analytics from a
query-only system into an actionable alerting platform. CoCo CLI users can now:
  1. Check individual supplier SLA compliance via natural language
  2. Get executive-level compliance reports on demand
  3. Receive escalation recommendations with penalty clause details

This demonstrates the hackathon's MCP requirement: connecting CoCo to an external
tool that reads from Snowflake data and provides actionable intelligence beyond
simple text-to-SQL queries.
